    mantic:figureIndex 4 ;
    mantic:hasBinaryVector "11110110" ;
    mantic:leftLeg "Ogbe" ;
    mantic:parable "Ogbe rises first — light at its first opening — and sets the stage of beginnings, clarity, the uncarried day. Over it walks Odi, the closed circle: Rises and extends, the reading now circles inward. The danger here is light that ignores the shadow exhausts itself by noon; the working gift is sanctuary and the second chance. \"However long the night, the dawn arrives without knocking. Yet what returns carries news of the far bank.\"" ;
