    mantic:leftLeg "Ogbe" ;
    mantic:parable "Ogbe rises first — light at its first opening — and sets the stage of beginnings, clarity, the uncarried day. Over it walks Irosun, the old stain on the new cloth: Rises and extends, the reading now seeps and steadies. The danger here is light that ignores the shadow exhausts itself by noon; the working gift is deep root, deep stand. \"However long the night, the dawn arrives without knocking. Yet the ground beneath holds the oldest vote.\"" ;
    mantic:rightLeg "Irosun" .

