    mantic:leftLeg "Ogbe" ;
    mantic:parable "Ogbe rises first — light at its first opening — and sets the stage of beginnings, clarity, the uncarried day. Over it walks Okanran, the tested vow: Rises and extends, the reading now tightens and holds. The danger here is light that ignores the shadow exhausts itself by noon; the working gift is loyalty proven is loyalty that leads. \"However long the night, the dawn arrives without knocking. Yet the tested vow outlives the easy one.\"" ;
