mantic:Odu009 a mantic:IfaOdu ;
    rdfs:label "Ogbe-Ogunda" ;
    mantic:figureIndex 9 ;
    mantic:hasBinaryVector "11111100" ;
    mantic:leftLeg "Ogbe" ;
    mantic:parable "Ogbe rises first — light at its first opening — and sets the stage of beginnings, clarity, the uncarried day. Over it walks Ogunda, the clearing blade: Rises and extends, the reading now cuts once, cleanly. The danger here is light that ignores the shadow exhausts itself by noon; the working gift is the obstacle removed at the root. \"However long the night, the dawn arrives without knocking. Yet one clean cut spares a hundred small ones.\"" ;
