    mantic:leftLeg "Ogbe" ;
    mantic:parable "Ogbe rises first — light at its first opening — and sets the stage of beginnings, clarity, the uncarried day. Over it walks Otura, the cool noon: Rises and extends, the reading now settles and clarifies. The danger here is light that ignores the shadow exhausts itself by noon; the working gift is the verdict that harms no one. \"However long the night, the dawn arrives without knocking. Yet the cool heart reads the hot hour correctly.\"" ;
    mantic:rightLeg "Otura" .

mantic:Odu014 a mantic:IfaOdu ;
