    mantic:leftLeg "Owonrin" ;
    mantic:parable "Owonrin rises first — the market on fire — and sets the stage of upheaval, reversal, unexpected news. Over it walks Ogbe, light at its first opening: Scatters and re-forms, the reading now rises and extends. The danger here is chasing every broken thing at once; the working gift is a clean start granted, not earned. \"When the market burns, the patient trader counts ash, the wise one counts stalls. Yet light renews its contract every morning.\"" ;
