    mantic:parable "Otura rises first — the cool noon — and sets the stage of peace, truth, the settled heart. Over it walks Ose, the blessing that outruns you: Settles and clarifies, the reading now arrives like weather. The danger here is calm mistaken for agreement; the working gift is winning without needing to win. \"Cool water settles the quarrel that hot words started. Yet the harvest answers the name of the patient farmer.\"" ;
