    rdfs:label "Ofun-Ika" ;
    mantic:figureIndex 251 ;
    mantic:hasBinaryVector "10000101" ;
    mantic:leftLeg "Ofun" ;
    mantic:parable "Ofun rises first — the long white road — and sets the stage of wisdom, patience, the elder's counsel. Over it walks Ika, the slow poison, the slow medicine: Extends and teaches, the reading now circles without sound. The danger here is wisdom deferred until the road forgives nothing; the working gift is mastery of the unseen lever. \"The one who asks the road three times arrives once, and whole. Yet the smallest rudder turns the longest canoe.\"" ;
    mantic:rightLeg "Ika" .

mantic:Odu252 a mantic:IfaOdu ;
    rdfs:label "Ofun-Oturupon" ;
    mantic:figureIndex 252 ;
    mantic:hasBinaryVector "10001010" ;
    mantic:leftLeg "Ofun" ;
    mantic:parable "Ofun rises first — the long white road — and sets the stage of wisdom, patience, the elder's counsel. Over it walks Oturupon, the long-walking elder: Extends and teaches, the reading now endures and ripens. The danger here is wisdom deferred until the road forgives nothing; the working gift is outlasting the thing that tested you. \"The one who asks the road three times arrives once, and whole. Yet patience is the only horse that finishes the race.\"" ;
    mantic:rightLeg "Oturupon" .

mantic:Odu253 a mantic:IfaOdu ;
    rdfs:label "Ofun-Otura" ;
    mantic:figureIndex 253 ;
    mantic:hasBinaryVector "10001101" ;
    mantic:leftLeg "Ofun" ;
    mantic:parable "Ofun rises first — the long white road — and sets the stage of wisdom, patience, the elder's counsel. Over it walks Otura, the cool noon: Extends and teaches, the reading now settles and clarifies. The danger here is wisdom deferred until the road forgives nothing; the working gift is the verdict that harms no one. \"The one who asks the road three times arrives once, and whole. Yet the cool heart reads the hot hour correctly.\"" ;
    mantic:rightLeg "Otura" .

mantic:Odu254 a mantic:IfaOdu ;
    rdfs:label "Ofun-Irete" ;
    mantic:figureIndex 254 ;
    mantic:hasBinaryVector "10001011" ;
    mantic:leftLeg "Ofun" ;
    mantic:parable "Ofun rises first — the long white road — and sets the stage of wisdom, patience, the elder's counsel. Over it walks Irete, the closed fist of order: Extends and teaches, the reading now grips and orders. The danger here is wisdom deferred until the road forgives nothing; the working gift is the will that finishes the sentence. \"The one who asks the road three times arrives once, and whole. Yet the matter ends where the will stands firm.\"" ;
    mantic:rightLeg "Irete" .

mantic:Odu255 a mantic:IfaOdu ;
    rdfs:label "Ofun-Ose" ;
    mantic:figureIndex 255 ;
    mantic:hasBinaryVector "10000001" ;
    mantic:leftLeg "Ofun" ;
    mantic:parable "Ofun rises first — the long white road — and sets the stage of wisdom, patience, the elder's counsel. Over it walks Ose, the blessing that outruns you: Extends and teaches, the reading now arrives like weather. The danger here is wisdom deferred until the road forgives nothing; the working gift is winning without needing to win. \"The one who asks the road three times arrives once, and whole. Yet the harvest answers the name of the patient farmer.\"" ;
    mantic:rightLeg "Ose" .

